"n":"Sucrose","r":[0.2148,0.8526,0.037,0.0296]}]}]}},"thumb":"content/genshin/builds/klee/261111-225049/en-1.t.webp","why":{"w":[{"name":"Reliquary of Truth","text":"Best general-purpose premium choice. CRIT stats and EM work especially well in reaction teams."},{"name":"Cashflow Supervision","text":"Excellent in Furina teams. HP changes activate Normal and Charged Attack bonuses, plus ATK Speed."},{"name":"Tome of the Eternal Flow","text":"A premium Furina option with high CD, Charged Attack buffs, and Energy recovery. Requires HP fluctuations."},{"name":"The Widsith","text":"Excellent four-star DMG with CD and powerful temporary buffs. Performance varies with the random buff and cooldown."},{"name":"Dawning Frost","text":"Strong reaction-focused option with a reliable EM bonus when Bennett is on the team. Best with Bennett in reaction teams."},{"name":"Solar Pearl","text":"CRIT Rate and Normal Attack, Skill, and Burst damage support her on-field rotation. Charged Attacks are not directly buffed."},{"name":"Flowing Purity","text":"Craftable ATK and Elemental DMG option. A healer must clear its Bond of Life to unlock the full bonus. Use a reliable healer."},{"name":"Dodoco Tales","text":"Themed event catalyst that improves Charged Attacks after Normal Attacks. Useful if owned, but weaker than modern options. Past limited-time event weapon."}],"a":[{"names":["A Day Carved From Rising Winds"],"text":"Best all-around set after completing Witch’s Homework. Strong ATK and CRIT Rate bonuses reward her upgraded kit.","stats":"ATK% / Pyro / CRIT"},{"names":["Crimson Witch of Flames"],"text":"Good reaction-focused alternative that buffs Vaporize and Overload damage and benefits from her Skill use.","stats":"ATK% / Pyro / CRIT"},{"names":["Marechaussee Hunter"],"text":"Strong in Furina teams as HP fluctuations grant CR.","stats":"ATK% / Pyro / CRIT"}],"t":[{"name":"Kloverload Royalty","members":["Klee","Chevreuse","Durin","Fischl"],"text":"Klee drives Overload while Chevreuse buffs and heals. Durin shreds resistance, and Fischl supplies Electro and Hexerei synergy.","roles":["On-field DPS","Healer / Buffer","Off-field DPS / Buffer","Off-field DPS / Battery"]},{"name":"Explosive Encore","members":["Klee","Furina","Fischl","Bennett"],"text":"Furina adds off-field Hydro damage, Fischl activates Hexerei and boosts damage, and Bennett heals and buffs Klee.","roles":["On-field DPS","Off-field DPS / Buffer","Off-field DPS / Battery","Healer / Buffer"]},{"name":"Burning Playdate","members":["Klee","Emilie","Durin","Bennett"],"text":"Klee maintains Burning for Emilie. Durin provides Pyro support and Hexerei synergy, while Bennett heals and buffs.","roles":["On-field DPS","Off-field DPS","Off-field DPS / Buffer","Healer / Buffer"]},{"name":"Fish Blasting","members":["Klee","Bennett","Xiangling","Sucrose"],"text":"Bennett buffs and heals, Xiangling adds Pyro damage, and Sucrose groups foes and activates Hexerei after Witch’s Homework.","roles":["On-field DPS","Healer / Buffer","Off-field DPS / Pyro Enabler","EM Buffer / Debuffer"]}],"v":"Hexerei DPS: Complete Witch’s Homework for Klee and a second Hexerei teammate. Prioritize Burst uptime and her Spark-enhanced attacks.\nOverload: Pair Klee with Chevreuse and off-field Electro. High Pyro application drives reactions, but small foes may be knocked away.\nFurina Carry: Furina enables Marechaussee Hunter and HP-dependent weapons. Bring a healer to sustain the team and build Fanfare.\nBurning: Emilie and Durin support Burning damage. Unfinished Reverie is an alternative if farming a dedicated Burning build.\nC2 Support: At C2, Klee can apply 23% enemy DEF reduction with her Skill and use Thrilling Tales to support a main damage dealer.","n":3},"seo":{"roles":["Main DPS"],"about":"Klee is an on-field Pyro DPS who floods enemies with explosive attacks. Complete her Witch’s Homework and pair her with another Hexerei character to unlock powerful Spark-enhanced attacks. Overload and Furina teams are excellent, while her C2 also offers DEF shred support.","pros":["Powerful Pyro damage","Strong Hexerei upgrades","Great team Energy support","Versatile team options"],"cons":["Needs Hexerei teammate","Can be interrupted","Burst needs consistent ER","Overload scatters enemies"],"weapons":["Reliquary of Truth","Cashflow Supervision","Tome of the Eternal Flow","The Widsith","Dawning Frost","Solar Pearl","Flowing Purity","Dodoco Tales"],"arts":[{"sets":["A Day Carved From Rising Winds"],"pcs":"4 pcs","role":""},{"sets":["Crimson Witch of Flames"],"pcs":"4 pcs","role":""},{"sets":["Marechaussee Hunter"],"pcs":"4 pcs","role":""}],"main":["ATK%","Pyro DMG Bonus / ATK%","CRIT Rate / CRIT DMG"],"stats":["ER: 125% - 140% (double Pyro)","ER: 140% - 160% (solo Pyro)","CRIT Rate: 60% - 75% before set buffs","CRIT DMG: 140% - 200%","ATK: 1,800 - 2,200 before buffs"],"vars":[{"title":"Hexerei On-field DPS","role":"On-field DPS","weapons":["Reliquary of Truth","Cashflow Supervision","The Widsith"],"arts":[{"sets":["A Day Carved From Rising Winds"],"pcs":"4 pcs"}],"stats":"Balance CRIT and ATK; EM with frequent reactions.","teams":"Qualifying Hexerei team and sustained field time.","when":"Use her updated synergy for high personal Pyro damage.","cond":"Damage depends on relevant Hexerei conditions.","notes":"","pre":false},{"title":"Furina Vape Carry","role":"On-field DPS","weapons":["Cashflow Supervision","The Widsith"],"arts":[{"sets":["Marechaussee Hunter"],"pcs":"4 pcs"},{"sets":["Crimson Witch of Flames"],"pcs":"4 pcs"}],"stats":"Account for Marechaussee CRIT Rate; EM helps if Vaporizing.","teams":"Furina and strong team healing.","when":"Furina enables an HP-change artifact route for Klee.","cond":"Vaporize consistency varies with Hydro application.","notes":"","pre":false},{"title":"C2 Resistance Support","role":"Support","weapons":["The Widsith","Solar Pearl"],"arts":[{"sets":["Crimson Witch of Flames"],"pcs":"4 pcs"}],"stats":"Build enough ER and utility; personal damage secondary.","teams":"Requires C2; use a team that benefits from DEF reduction.","when":"Quickswap Klee can provide utility rather than occupying long field time.","cond":"C2 required for DEF reduction.","notes":"","pre":false}],"mats":["Agnidus Agate Sliver","Agnidus Agate Fragment","Agnidus Agate Chunk","Agnidus Agate Gemstone","Everflame Seed","Teachings of Freedom","Guide to Freedom","Philosophies of Freedom","Divining Scroll","Sealed Scroll","Forbidden Curse Scroll","Philanemo Mushroom","Ring of Boreas","Crown of Insight","Mora","Hero's Wit"],"talents":[{"name":"Normal Attack","pri":"Level 9+"},{"name":"Elemental Skill","pri":"Level 8–9"},{"name":"Elemental Burst","pri":"Level 8–9"}],"teams":[{"name":"Kloverload Royalty","members":["Klee","Chevreuse","Durin","Fischl"]},{"name":"Explosive Encore","members":["Klee","Furina","Fischl","Bennett"]},{"name":"Burning Playdate","members":["Klee","Emilie","Durin","Bennett"]},{"name":"Fish Blasting","members":["Klee","Bennett","Xiangling","Sucrose"]}]}}],"title":"Klee","el":"Pyro"}